   "WeaponConf_21030076_BgDescription": "So close to crumbling, the flower gave itself to the softness of dreams. There, its thoughts froze and its hopes set, until it withered in the lovely dream cradle.\nIt waits, and waits... It waits on for a prayer, an accident, a chance to bloom again and find its peace.",
   "WeaponConf_21030076_Desc": "Increases Max HP by {0}. Casting Resonance Liberation restores {1} points of Concerto Energy, triggered once every {2}s. All Resonators in the team gain Soothed Soul for {4}s when the wielder provides healing with Heavy Attack. When Soothed Soul is active, if a Resonator in the team gains Unison or triggers Unison Response, that Resonator gains {3} ATK increase for {7}s. This effect is removed when Soothed Soul ends. When the wielder provides healing with Heavy Attack, the active Resonator also gains {5} Echo Skill DMG Bonus for {6}s. Effects of the same name do not stack.",
   "WeaponConf_21030076_ObtainedShowDescription": "So close to crumbling, the flower gave itself to the softness of dreams. There, its thoughts froze and its hopes set, until it withered in the lovely dream cradle.\nIt waits, and waits... It waits on for a prayer, an accident, a chance to bloom again and find its peace.",
